   "t": "Наливай. Поехали.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Kostya goes off with his ring, and Max starts drinking. Russian says drug drugu, literally 'friend to friend', for 'to each other'. See you next time!",
